'''Wands''' is an [[item class]] of one-handed [[ranged]] [[weapons]] that require [[intelligence]], have a very high base [[critical strike chance]], low base [[physical damage]]. While wands are more obviously suited for [[spell]]s, they can be used and crafted for [[attack]]s.

Wands may be [[dual wield]]ed or equipped with a [[shield]], but cannot be equipped alongside other one-handed weapons such as [[sceptre]]s or [[rune dagger]]s.

==Implicit==
Wands can be broken down to subclass by their implicit. In the past, most of them have {{c|mod|x% increased Spell Damage}} [[implicit]] [[modifier]], but now only {{il|Sage Wand}} and its sister variants, as well as the starting wand {{il|Driftwood Wand}}, the end game wands {{il|Demon's Horn}}, {{il|Opal Wand}} and {{il|Tornado Wand}} have this implicit. Some legacy wand basetypes also have this implicit. 

Except for legacy variants, {{il|Spiraled Wand}} and its sister variant have {{c|mod|Adds # to # Lightning Damage to Spells and Attacks}} implicit, while {{il|Quartz Wand}} (and its variant) has cold and {{il|Goat's Horn}} has fire implicit, respectively. The end game wands {{il|Demon's Horn}}, {{il|Opal Wand}} and {{il|Tornado Wand}} have a brief period that have these added damage implicit as well, but reverted to {{c|mod|x% increased Spell Damage}} in version 3.29.

{{il|Kinetic Wand}} and its inferior variants have {{c|mod|Cannot roll Caster Modifiers}}, making them intended to be used by wand attack builds. {{il|Convoking Wand|Convoking Wands}} (and its inferior act variants) have the {{c|mod|Minions deal #% increased Damage}} implicit. Despite not being stated in the implicit, the basetype is also able to roll minion modifiers, making the basetype intended to be used by minion build. Some wand minion mods can also appear on minion rings (e.g. {{il|Bone Ring}}) and shields (e.g. {{il|Fossilised Spirit Shield}}) as well.

Lastly, [[Maraketh weapon]]s with this item class have a {{c|mod|x% increased Cast Speed}} [[implicit]]. [[Experimented base type]]s with this item class have the {{c|mod|Gain an Endurance, Frenzy or Power Charge every 6 seconds}} implicit.

